Raw upstream data under data/raw/ is downloaded separately under upstream terms;
it is not a project relicensing grant. No raw data, private research, local review,
environment, build cache or external state/ evidence is part of the tracked release.
Locally supplied state/ verification receipts are project documentation under CC BY 4.0;
Git bundles preserve the file scopes above rather than changing their licences.
There is no vendored dependency or other third-party asset exception in the release.

